request.description:
Lists all subcategories (flat — no products included). Filter by `categoryId` on the client, or use *Get all Categories* which already nests them. Currently public.

**200 OK**
```json
{
  "data": [
    { "id": "5d2c...", "name": "Classic Pizzas", "description": "...", "categoryId": "0b6f9a1e-...", "imageUrl": "...", "imagePath": "...", "createdAt": "...", "updatedAt": "..." }
  ],
  "meta": null
}
```

**Errors**: `500` `{ "error": { "message": "Failed to fetch subcategories" } }`

